---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="MachineMachine | AI Workforce Platform" description="The first platform for autonomous AI organizations. Deploy entire AI departments, not just chatbots. Enterprise-grade infrastructure for the €2T workforce automation market.">
  <header>
    <nav class="container">
      <a href="/" class="logo">M²</a>
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a></li>
        <li><a href="#use-cases">Use Cases</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/docs">Documentation</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/machine-machine/machinemachine">GitHub</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge">
        <span>AI Workforce Platform</span>
      </div>
      <h1>Everyone's building AI for individuals.<br/>We're building AI for organizations.</h1>
      <p class="hero-description">
        Deploy autonomous AI departments that work together, learn continuously, and scale operations. 
        The infrastructure layer for the €2 trillion enterprise AI transformation.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="/early-access" class="btn btn-primary">Request Early Access</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-secondary">Learn More</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="gradient-orb"></div>
        <div class="floating-elements">
          <div class="floating-card">Agent Spawning</div>
          <div class="floating-card">Organizational Memory</div>
          <div class="floating-card">Multi-Agent Coordination</div>
          <div class="floating-card">Self-Improvement</div>
          <div class="floating-card">Role-Based Architecture</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="social-proof">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="proof-text">Trusted by forward-thinking enterprises</p>
      <div class="proof-logos">
        <div class="proof-placeholder">Enterprise A</div>
        <div class="proof-placeholder">Enterprise B</div>
        <div class="proof-placeholder">Enterprise C</div>
        <div class="proof-placeholder">Enterprise D</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="positioning">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>The AI Assistant Market is Commoditizing</h2>
      <p class="positioning-subtitle">Personal AI tools race to the bottom. Organizational AI creates lasting moats.</p>
      
      <div class="comparison-table">
        <div class="comparison-column personal">
          <h3>Personal AI Assistants</h3>
          <div class="comparison-items">
            <div class="comparison-item">Individual productivity tools</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">Chat-based interfaces</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">No persistent memory</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">Single-user focused</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">Commoditized market</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">Consumer pricing pressure</div>
          </div>
          <div class="comparison-examples">ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot</div>
        </div>

        <div class="comparison-column organizational">
          <h3>Organizational AI (MachineMachine)</h3>
          <div class="comparison-items">
            <div class="comparison-item">Enterprise infrastructure platform</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">Multi-agent orchestration</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">Institutional knowledge base</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">Team-wide coordination</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">Blue ocean opportunity</div>
            <div class="comparison-item">Enterprise value pricing</div>
          </div>
          <div class="comparison-examples">No direct competitors</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>How MachineMachine Works</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Three simple steps to deploy your AI workforce</p>
      
      <div class="workflow-steps">
        <div class="workflow-step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Define Organization</h3>
            <p>Specify roles, responsibilities, and objectives. Set governance rules and resource allocation. Design your org chart with AI-first thinking.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="workflow-step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Deploy Agents</h3>
            <p>Spawn specialized AI agents to fill roles. Each agent brings domain expertise and coordinates with teammates through the organizational memory layer.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="workflow-step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>Scale Operations</h3>
            <p>Agents work autonomously, learn from outcomes, and evolve the organization. Add new roles, adjust processes, expand capabilities as needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="use-cases" id="use-cases">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Enterprise Use Cases</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Real-world applications driving immediate ROI</p>
      
      <div class="use-case-grid">
        <div class="use-case">
          <div class="use-case-icon">📊</div>
          <h3>Tax Compliance Automation</h3>
          <p>Deploy a full tax department: research agents monitor regulatory changes, compliance agents ensure adherence, filing agents handle submissions. Reduce compliance costs by 80% while eliminating human error.</p>
          <div class="use-case-metrics">
            <span>80% cost reduction</span>
            <span>99.9% accuracy</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="use-case">
          <div class="use-case-icon">🎯</div>
          <h3>Customer Operations</h3>
          <p>Scale customer success with coordinated agent teams: support agents handle inquiries, account managers nurture relationships, product agents gather feedback. Deliver enterprise-grade service at startup costs.</p>
          <div class="use-case-metrics">
            <span>24/7 availability</span>
            <span>Infinite scalability</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="use-case">
          <div class="use-case-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Software Factory</h3>
          <p>Build an autonomous development organization: architect agents design systems, developer agents write code, QA agents test releases. Ship products 10x faster with consistent quality standards.</p>
          <div class="use-case-metrics">
            <span>10x faster delivery</span>
            <span>Zero technical debt</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="differentiators">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Core Technology Differentiators</h2>
      <div class="differentiator-grid">
        <div class="differentiator">
          <h4>Agent Spawning</h4>
          <p>Spin up entire AI departments instantly. Define roles, spawn agents, begin operations within minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="differentiator">
          <h4>Organizational Memory</h4>
          <p>Persistent knowledge that survives individual agents. Institutional learning that compounds over time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="differentiator">
          <h4>Multi-Agent Coordination</h4>
          <p>Agents that work together seamlessly. No siloes, no communication gaps, unified objective pursuit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="differentiator">
          <h4>Self-Improvement</h4>
          <p>Organizations that evolve autonomously. Optimize processes, adjust strategies, adapt to changing conditions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="differentiator">
          <h4>Role-Based Architecture</h4>
          <p>Fill any role with AI or human interchangeably. Hybrid organizations that leverage the best of both.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="differentiator">
          <h4>Enterprise Security</h4>
          <p>SOC2-ready infrastructure. Private deployment options. Full audit trails and access controls.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="market-opportunity">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Market Opportunity</h2>
      <div class="market-stats">
        <div class="market-stat">
          <div class="stat-number">€2T</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Total Addressable Market<br/>(Enterprise AI + Workforce Automation)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="market-stat">
          <div class="stat-number">€480B</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Serviceable Addressable Market<br/>(Fortune 2000 Organizations)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="market-stat">
          <div class="stat-number">Blue Ocean</div>
          <div class="stat-label">No Direct Competitors<br/>(First-mover Advantage)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="team">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Founded by Enterprise AI Veterans</h2>
      <p class="team-subtitle">Deep expertise in large-scale AI deployment and organizational design</p>
      <div class="team-note">
        Team details available to qualified investors
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta" id="early-access">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Join the AI Workforce Revolution</h2>
      <p>MachineMachine is in private beta. Early access available to select enterprise partners.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/early-access" class="btn btn-primary">Request Early Access</a>
        <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-secondary">Technical Documentation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/about">About</a>
        <a href="/docs">Documentation</a>
        <a href="https://api.machinemachine.ai">API</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/machine-machine/machinemachine">GitHub</a>
        <a href="/protocol" class="protocol-link">Machine Protocol (Open Source)</a>
      </div>
      <p class="copyright">© 2026 MachineMachine. The platform for autonomous organizations.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :root {
    --primary: #3b82f6;
    --secondary: #8b5cf6;
    --accent: #06d6a0;
    --dark: #0a0a0f;
    --darker: #050508;
    --gray: #6b7280;
    --light: #e5e7eb;
    --border: #1f2937;
    --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }

  body {
    background-color: var(--dark);
    color: var(--light);
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  /* Header */
  header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(5, 5, 8, 0.95);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .logo {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    color: var(--light);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Hero Section */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 8rem 2rem 4rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
  }

  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #a0a0a0);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .hero-description {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--gray);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .hero-visual {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .gradient-orb {
    width: 400px;
    height: 300px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, 
      rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3) 0%, 
      rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2) 40%, 
      transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    animation: pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .floating-elements {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
  }

  .floating-card {
    position: absolute;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--light);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .floating-card:nth-child(1) { top: 20%; left: 10%; animation-delay: 0s; }
  .floating-card:nth-child(2) { top: 10%; right: 15%; animation-delay: 1s; }
  .floating-card:nth-child(3) { bottom: 30%; left: 5%; animation-delay: 2s; }
  .floating-card:nth-child(4) { bottom: 20%; right: 10%; animation-delay: 3s; }
  .floating-card:nth-child(5) { top: 50%; right: 5%; animation-delay: 4s; }

  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.6; }
    50% { transform: scale(1.05); opacity: 0.8; }
  }

  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
  }

  /* Social Proof */
  .social-proof {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    background: var(--darker);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .proof-text {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--gray);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .proof-logos {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 3rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .proof-placeholder {
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--gray);
    font-weight: 600;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  /* Buttons */
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
    color: white;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--light);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: var(--light);
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Section Styling */
  section {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--light), var(--gray));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--gray);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Positioning Section */
  .positioning {
    background: var(--darker);
  }

  .positioning-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--gray);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .comparison-table {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .comparison-column {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .comparison-column.organizational {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
  }

  .comparison-column h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--light);
  }

  .comparison-column.organizational h3 {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .comparison-items {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .comparison-item {
    padding: 0.75rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: var(--gray);
  }

  .comparison-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .comparison-examples {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--gray);
    font-style: italic;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  /* How It Works */
  .workflow-steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .workflow-step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .step-number {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-content h3 {
    color: var(--light);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .step-content p {
    color: var(--gray);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Use Cases */
  .use-cases {
    background: var(--darker);
  }

  .use-case-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(350px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .use-case {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .use-case:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
  }

  .use-case-icon {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: block;
  }

  .use-case h3 {
    color: var(--light);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .use-case p {
    color: var(--gray);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .use-case-metrics {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .use-case-metrics span {
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Differentiators */
  .differentiator-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .differentiator {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .differentiator h4 {
    color: var(--light);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .differentiator p {
    color: var(--gray);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Market Opportunity */
  .market-opportunity {
    background: var(--darker);
  }

  .market-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .market-stat {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .stat-label {
    color: var(--gray);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* Team */
  .team {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .team-subtitle {
    color: var(--gray);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .team-note {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--gray);
    font-style: italic;
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta {
    text-align: center;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }

  .cta p {
    color: var(--gray);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 600px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Footer */
  footer {
    background: var(--darker);
    padding: 3rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: var(--gray);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

